{"product_id":"murder-on-the-minnesota-ocean-liner-mysteries","title":"Murder on the Minnesota (Ocean Liner Mysteries)","description":"\u003cp\u003eNew York, 1908. Private detectives George Dillman and Genevieve Masefield plan to take a break from work upon the Cunard Line's fleet with the offer of employment upon the Minnesota, a freighter and passenger vessel, which is bound for the Far East.Although the pair are investigating the possibility of a smuggling operation on the route, at first all appears to be smooth sailing, but the voyage takes a dire turn when a fiery Catholic missionary is murdered and it proves to be the first in a series of crimes that plague the crossing.Previously published under the name Conrad Allen, the Ocean Liner series sets sail for a new generation of readers.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Edward Marston\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749027797\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45788116287641,"sku":"10RB9780749027797","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ec9c5141c49_Murder_on_the_Minnesota__Ocean_Liner_Mysteries__Edward_Marston.jpg?v=1760369327","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/murder-on-the-minnesota-ocean-liner-mysteries","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}